\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 US student worker unions face threats under second Trump administration\b0\par\par\uc2 Michael Sainato \par \uc2 804 \uc2 words\par \uc2 28 December 2024\par 16:02 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2024.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Organizers try to pre-empt action by incoming president to \u8216\'20\'18constrict or eliminate\u8217\'20\'19 labor rights\par \par \uc2 Student workers are bracing for the incoming Trump administration to \u8220\'20\'1Cconstrict or eliminate\u8221\'20\'1D their labor rights, after a surge in union organizing on college campuses.\par \par \uc2 N {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.epi.org/blog/the-inspiring-wave-of-student-worker-organizing-that-the-trump-administration-tried-to-stop/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 early 45,000 student employees}}}\uc2  formed unions between 2022 to 2024 between 44 bargaining units. As of earlier this year, an {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/business/article/2024/aug/29/higher-education-us-unions-growing-report"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 estimated 38% }}}\uc2  of all graduate student employees in the US were unionized.\par \par \uc2 But organizers fear this trend will stutter as Trump prepares to return to office. During his first presidency, officials {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.epi.org/blog/the-inspiring-wave-of-student-worker-organizing-that-the-trump-administration-tried-to-stop/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 tried to exclude}}}\uc2  1.5 million private college and university student employees from exercising collective bargaining rights under the National Labor Relations Act, arguing these workers were not \u8220\'20\'1Cemployees\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 While the \uc2 National Labor Relations Board\uc2  (\uc2 NLRB\uc2 ), the country\u8217\'20\'19s top labor watchdog, withdrew this proposal months after \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2  took office in March 2021, Trump\u8217\'20\'19s re-election sets the stage for another battle.\par \par \uc2 William A Herbert, executive director of the National Center for the Study of Collective Bargaining in Higher Education and the Professions, predicted sweeping changes under Trump once his administration overhauls the labor watchdog.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1COnce President Trump appoints a new majority of \uc2 NLRB\uc2  board members, future decisions by that majority are likely to constrict or eliminate existing labor rights on private sector campuses,\u8221\'20\'1D said Herbert.\par \par \uc2 Trump may try again to overrule a 2016 decision which held that graduate and undergraduate student employees were covered under the National Labor Relations Act, Herbert suggested, and the new \uc2 NLRB\uc2  general counsel could modify or abandon the board\u8217\'20\'19s current approach to college athletes.\par \par \uc2 At some colleges, student workers are trying to pre-empt such action.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThere is that feeling of knowing of what may or may not happen next in the new year,\u8221\'20\'1D said Dia Brown, an engineering graduate student employee at \uc2 Penn State\uc2 . \u8220\'20\'1CIt just makes it feel more important to keep pushing forward.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Earlier this month, a union election petition was {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/GETUPgrads/status/1864436943766847669"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 filed}}}\uc2  with the Pennsylvania labor board by the Coalition of Graduate Employees at \uc2 Penn State\uc2 -\uc2 UAW\uc2  to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.facebook.com/permalink.php/?story_fbid=492962830434632&id=100091627584873"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 represent}}}\uc2  around 5,000 graduate student employees.\par \par \uc2 Trump\u8217\'20\'19s victory \u8220\'20\'1Cmakes it even more important to make sure that we get this [union] election, so that we can get into bargaining, get a contract and get more security for all of our grad students\u8221\'20\'1D, said Brown who cited securing protections for international students as a top priority in the face of Trump\u8217\'20\'19s plan to enact mass deportations. Some schools around the US have {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.nbcnews.com/news/asian-america/trump-inauguration-international-students-return-college-rcna183851"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 advised}}}\uc2  international students to arrive on campuses before Trump takes office.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CMy expenses are so cutthroat with the funding that I get through my stipend each month,\u8221\'20\'1D Brown added. \u8220\'20\'1CI want me and \u8230\'20\'26 other grad students like me, who are struggling financially with the current stipends, to be able to feel confident to meet their needs, and meet their living expenses too.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThey really need to make this a better, more secure workplace and ultimately a better institution,\u8221\'20\'1D added Owen Harrington, a geography graduate student employee at \uc2 Penn State\uc2 . \u8220\'20\'1CSo it\u8217\'20\'19s about time.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 A date for a union election has not yet been set by the Pennsylvania labor board.\par \par \uc2 A spokesperson for \uc2 Penn State\uc2  said in an email: \u8220\'20\'1CWhen we receive the petition, we will carefully review it, taking all perspectives into account. We remain committed to open dialogue as we move forward in this process.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Elsewhere, however, graduate student employees attempting to unionize have already hit resistance as colleges await the second Trump presidency.\par \par \uc2 At Vanderbilt, a private university in Nashville, Tennessee, graduate student workers filed a petition for a union election to join the \uc2 United Auto Workers\uc2  in October, with the university opposing the effort, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://gradschool.vanderbilt.edu/grad-student-union-facts/#h2-our-position"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 claiming}}}\uc2  they were students rather than workers.\par \par \uc2 The university also {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://vanderbilthustler.com/2024/11/13/vanderbilt-files-complaint-against-national-labor-relations-board-alleging-ferpa-violations/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 filed}}}\uc2  a complaint against the \uc2 NLRB\uc2 , which had requested student information to determine the scope of the union election and prospective bargaining unit. After a judge ruled in the university\u8217\'20\'19s favor, the \uc2 UAW\uc2  withdrew the election petition earlier this month.\par \par \uc2 Such withdrawals have been a rarity in recent years: graduate student workers won {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.epi.org/blog/the-inspiring-wave-of-student-worker-organizing-that-the-trump-administration-tried-to-stop/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 over 90%}}}\uc2  of union elections from 2022 to 2024, often in {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.peoplespolicyproject.org/2023/12/22/graduate-worker-unions-win-major-gains-and-strengthen-the-labor-movement/#:~:text=Looking%20at%20some%20representative%20examples,in%20their%20pay%20and%20conditions."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 landslide votes }}}\uc2  at some of the top universities in the US,.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe union\u8217\'20\'19s decision to withdraw its petition and demand provides a path for us to move forward together,\u8221\'20\'1D Vanderbilt officials said in a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.e2ma.net/message/t6xktp/5zwchouc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 statement.}}}\par \par \uc2 But Vanderbilt Graduate Workers United made clear it was not backing down. \u8220\'20\'1CThis is not a defeat,\u8221\'20\'1D it said in a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.instagram.com/vandygradunion/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 statement}}}\uc2 , claiming the university \u8220\'20\'1Cbeat the law and got lucky with national political events. They did not beat US!\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 As thousands of student workers attempt to unionize, national political events will probably have an outsized impact on their efforts in the years ahead.\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020241228ekcs001p6\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
