\par\par \uc2 Business\par \b \uc2 Starbucks\uc2  workers\u8217\'20\'19 strike could reach hundreds of stores by Christmas Eve\b0\par\par\uc2 Edward Helmore \par \uc2 439 \uc2 words\par \uc2 20 December 2024\par 16:38 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2024.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Walkouts will start in Los Angeles, Chicago and Seattle, after union said it was making little progress with chain\u8217\'20\'19s owners over pay and conditions\par \par \uc2 Workers at {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/business/starbucks"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Starbucks}}}\uc2  stores in three cities plan to go on strike on Friday after a union representing more than 11,000 baristas in the US said it was making little progress with the giant coffee chain\u8217\'20\'19s owners over pay and conditions.\par \par \uc2 The walkouts will start in Los Angeles, Chicago and Seattle, with strike action set to spread each day and, subject to a deal, reach hundreds of stores by Christmas Eve.\par \par \uc2 The strike comes as workers at the online giant \uc2 Amazon\uc2  was also hit by a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/technology/2024/dec/16/amazon-workers-strike-new-york-atlanta-chicago"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 worker\u8217\'20\'19s walkout}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Starbucks Workers United, the union that has organized workers at 535 company-owned US stores since 2021, said \uc2 Starbucks\uc2  has failed to honor a pledge to meet to reach an agreement this year.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CUnion baristas know their value, and they\u8217\'20\'19re not going to accept a proposal that doesn\u8217\'20\'19t treat them as true partners,\u8221\'20\'1D said \uc2 Lynne Fox\uc2 , president of Workers United.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIn a year when \uc2 Starbucks\uc2  invested so many millions in top executive talent, it has failed to present the baristas who make its company run with a viable economic proposal,\u8221\'20\'1D {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cbsnews.com/news/planned-starbucks-strikes-in-3-cities-could-spread-nationwide-during-crucial-holiday-shopping-season/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said Fatemeh Alhadjaboodi}}}\uc2 , a \uc2 Starbucks\uc2  barista and bargaining delegate.\par \par \uc2 The union noted that \uc2 Starbucks\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19 new chairman and CEO, \uc2 Brian Niccol\uc2 , could make more than $100m in his first year, but the company had proposed a pay deal with no new wage increases for unionized servers and a 1.5% increase in future years.\par \par \uc2 But \uc2 Starbucks\uc2  has said it already offers pay and benefits \u8211\'20\'13 including free college tuition and paid family leave \u8211\'20\'13 worth $30 per hour for baristas who work at least 20 hours per week.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe are ready to continue negotiations to reach agreements. We need the union to return to the table,\u8221\'20\'1D \uc2 Starbucks\uc2  said in a statement.\par \par \uc2 In November 2023, \uc2 Starbucks\uc2  workers at more than 200 stores walked out on Red Cup Day, when the company gives away reusable cups. Workers also went on strike in June 2023 when some stores banned Pride month displays.\par \par \uc2 Baristas have said understaffing due, in part, to an algorithm \uc2 Starbucks\uc2  uses to assign store labor, combined with customers making complex orders, and the need to juggle in-person, drive-thru, mobile and delivery orders, have made their jobs harder.\par \par \uc2 About 8% of \uc2 Starbucks\uc2  customers wait between 15 and 30 minutes for their order, according to a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/features/2024-05-29/starbucks-wait-times-jump-after-changing-work-algorithm-staffers-say?sref=fqqmZ8gi"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 study cited by Bloomberg earlier this year}}}\uc2 , compared with minimal no wait times in 2019.\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020241220ekck001uw\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
