\par\par \uc2 Technology\par \b \uc2 Amazon workers across US gear up to strike this week\b0\par\par\uc2 Michael Sainato \par \uc2 422 \uc2 words\par \uc2 18 December 2024\par 01:22 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2024.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Move comes after company fails to meet deadline to begin contract talks with workers in Staten Island, New York\par \par \uc2 Thousands of Amazon workers are gearing up to strike from Thursday, days before Christmas, over the tech giant\u8217\'20\'19s refusal to begin negotiations over a contract.\par \par \uc2 Union locals are preparing members for pickets and actions outside Amazon facilities around the US.\par \par \uc2 Amazon was given a deadline of 15 December to agree to open talks with workers at the company\u8217\'20\'19s JFK8 warehouse in Staten Island, which became the first Amazon warehouse in the US to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/technology/2022/apr/01/amazon-union-groups-see-hope-workers-vote-alabama-new-york"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 win a union election}}}\uc2  in 2022.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1COur sisters and brothers at Amazon need our help and support \u8211\'20\'13 now is the time to show them what being part of the Teamster family is all about,\u8221\'20\'1D wrote \uc2 Teamsters\uc2  local 299 in Detroit in a \uc2 Facebook\uc2  post, which announced strike shifts at an Amazon facility in metro Detroit on 19 and 20 December.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 Teamsters\uc2  did not immediately respond for comment. The post by \uc2 Teamsters\uc2  local 299 was later deleted.\par \par \uc2 A {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/JwJpdx/status/1868830682333823316"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 flyer}}}\uc2  from \uc2 Teamsters\uc2  local 206 in Portland, Oregon, also announced a picket at an Amazon warehouse on Thursday and Friday. \u8220\'20\'1CAmazon has refused to recognize or bargain with the \uc2 Teamsters\uc2  at its facilities,\u8221\'20\'1D it said.\par \par \uc2 Amazon workers in Staten Island; at {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://teamster.org/2024/12/amazon-teamsters-vote-to-authorize-strike-at-two-major-nyc-warehouses/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DBK4 }}}\uc2  in Queens, New York; {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/Teamsters/status/1869112844794445861"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 four facilities}}}\uc2  in southern California; and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://teamster.org/2024/12/amazon-teamsters-in-skokie-authorize-strike/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 drivers }}}\uc2  at DIL7 in Skokie, Illinois, voted to authorize strikes over the past week. Workers at two Amazon facilities outside Atlanta have {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wrdw.com/2024/12/17/ga-amazon-strike-could-hinder-holiday-deliveries-region/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 threatened}}}\uc2  to strike.\par \par \uc2 In a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://teamster.org/2024/12/amazon-teamsters-authorize-strikes-at-four-california-facilities/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 statement }}}\uc2  announcing the four California facility strike authorization votes, the \uc2 Teamsters\uc2  general president Sean O\u8217\'20\'19Brien said: \u8220\'20\'1CThe corporate elitists who run Amazon are leaving workers with no choice. Greedy executives are pushing thousands of hardworking Americans to the brink.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CAmazon rakes in more money than anybody, they subject workers to injury and abuse at every turn, and they illegally claim not to be the rightful employer of nearly half their workforce.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThis rigged system cannot continue. Amazon must be held accountable to workers and consumers alike. If workers are forced onto the picket line, Amazon will be striking itself.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Amazon {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/business/2024/dec/13/amazon-new-york-strike"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 criticized}}}\uc2  the \uc2 Teamsters\uc2  as the strike authorization votes were announced.\par \par \uc2 Spokesperson Eileen Hands said in a statement: \u8220\'20\'1CThe truth is that the \uc2 Teamsters\uc2  have actively threatened, intimidated, and attempted to coerce Amazon employees and third-party drivers to join them, which is illegal and is the subject of multiple pending unfair labor practice charges against the union.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020241217ekch003jv\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
