\par\par \uc2 Science\par \b \uc2 SpaceX\uc2  valued at $350bn as company agrees to buy shares from employees\b0\par\par\uc2 Dan Milmo Global technology editor \par \uc2 421 \uc2 words\par \uc2 11 December 2024\par 14:27 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2024.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Company and investors to buy up to $1.25bn of stock at $185 a share, up from $112 a few months agoBusiness live \u8211\'20\'13 latest updates\par \par \uc2 Elon Musk\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s rocket company \uc2 SpaceX\uc2  and its investors have agreed to buy shares from its employees, valuing the business at $350bn (\u163\'00\'A3275bn).\par \par \uc2 The privately owned US business, in which Musk owns a 42% stake, and its backers are buying the stock at $185 a share, up from $112 a few months ago, according to an internal email seen by \uc2 Bloomberg\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The transaction values \uc2 SpaceX\uc2  at approximately $350bn, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2024-12-10/spacex-share-sale-is-said-to-value-company-at-about-350-billion"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 according to the report }}}\uc2 , with the \uc2 Financial Times\uc2  also reporting the same valuation. The figure represents a near doubling of its reported value a year ago, when another employee share sale valued the business at $180bn.\par \par \uc2 SpaceX\uc2  and its investors have reportedly agreed to buy up to $1.25bn worth of employees\u8217\'20\'19 shares, with the company alone offering to snap up $500m.\par \par \uc2 Investors in \uc2 SpaceX\uc2  include the UK-based investment company Baillie Gifford and the US venture capital firm Sequoia Capital.\par \par \uc2 Musk\u8217\'20\'19s personal fortune, the biggest in the world, has soared since he {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/technology/2024/nov/06/how-elon-musk-stands-to-benefit-from-trump-presidency"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 helped Donald Trump win the US presidential election }}}\uc2  with his financial heft. The day after the election, the \uc2 Tesla\uc2  chief executive\u8217\'20\'19s wealth was estimated at $264bn, with his 13% stake in the electric carmaker making a substantial contribution to that wealth. Musk is now worth $384bn, according to Bloomberg.\par \par \uc2 Musk\u8217\'20\'19s other business interests include the artificial intelligence startup \uc2 xAI\uc2 , which was {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/technology/2023/jul/13/elon-musk-launches-xai-startup-pro-humanity-terminator-future"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 founded in July last year }}}\uc2  and recently achieved a valuation of $50bn, and the brain implant company \uc2 Neuralink\uc2 , which is reportedly worth $8bn.\par \par \uc2 He also owns X, the social media company formerly known as \uc2 Twitter\uc2 . He bought it for $44bn but its valuation has slipped after advertisers withdrew spending from the platform. Nonetheless, Musk\u8217\'20\'19s amplified presence on X, where he has more than 200 million followers, helped distribute pro-Trump messages during the US presidential campaign.\par \par \uc2 SpaceX\uc2  and \uc2 Tesla\uc2  already earn substantial sums from \uc2 US government\uc2  contracts, and the financial community expects Musk\u8217\'20\'19s interests to flourish further under a Trump administration.\par \par \uc2 In October alone, \uc2 SpaceX\uc2 , which also owns the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/technology/article/2024/sep/08/alarm-at-musk-starlink-dominance-brazil-amazon"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Starlink satellite internet unit }}}\uc2 , secured contracts worth more than $700m from the US Space Force. \uc2 SpaceX\uc2  and \uc2 Tesla\uc2  have received at least $15.4bn in government contracts over the past decade, according to a recent New York Times analysis.\par \par \uc2 SpaceX\uc2  declined to comment.\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020241211ekcb001s5\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
