\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 Trump\u8217\'20\'19s policies \u8216\'20\'18should be turning off farmers\u8217\'20\'19 \u8211\'20\'13 why did so many vote for him?\b0\par\par\uc2 Stephen Starr in Dayton, Ohio \par \uc2 1,072 \uc2 words\par \uc2 7 December 2024\par 17:03 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2024.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Plans of deportation and trade wars should concern farmers, yet they backed him by a three-to-one margin\par \par \uc2 Every year, farmers in {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/california"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 California }}}\uc2  \u8217\'20\'19s Central valley heavily rely on the labor of hundreds of thousands of immigrant agricultural workers to grow and harvest their crops.\par \par \uc2 But for many in a region that produces one-quarter of the country\u8217\'20\'19s food, president-elect {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/donaldtrump"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Donald Trump }}}\uc2  \u8217\'20\'19s promise to deport millions of undocumented migrants \u8211\'20\'13 a move that could result in national agricultural output {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.newsweek.com/donald-trump-mass-deportation-farmers-1987371"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 falling by up to $60bn }}}\uc2  \u8211\'20\'13 is not a threat to their livelihoods.\par \par \uc2 Some just don\u8217\'20\'19t seem to believe him. \u8220\'20\'1CI don\u8217\'20\'19t see that there\u8217\'20\'19s going to be a push to go chase anyone who\u8217\'20\'19s willing to work on a farm,\u8221\'20\'1D says Tom Barcellos, who milks 1,600 Holstein cows on his {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/environment/farming"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 farm }}}\uc2  in Tulare county.\par \par \uc2 As Trump\u8217\'20\'19s tariffs and deportations threats grow louder, many Americans are at a loss to understand why voters in farming-dependent counties across the US are so loyal to the president-elect, backing him by a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://investigatemidwest.org/2024/11/13/trump-election-farming-counties-trade-war/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 margin of three to one }}}\uc2  in November\u8217\'20\'19s presidential election.\par \par \uc2 But farmers such as Barcellos say they trust Trump.\par \par \uc2 During his first White House bid, Trump met Barcellos and other Central valley growers in person to hear out their concerns around water access for their farms. At the time, environmental regulations meant that farmers and growers in the region faced higher restrictions to accessing water in part due to efforts to protect fish and other wildlife.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CHe understood our situation with water; he understood what the business climate was in agriculture and that there was so much regulation that was hampering our ability to do anything,\u8221\'20\'1D he says.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CHe promised to make improvements.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Three years into his administration, in 2020, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://apnews.com/article/ddaf365a5b5528d4949b478e92daf98b"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Trump did exactly that }}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 As the Biden era comes to a close, farmers such as Barcellos say they are drowning in expenses and red tape resulting from strict environmental and emissions regulations introduced by Democratic leaders at the federal and state levels, at a time when American agriculture is in free fall.\par \par \uc2 A {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.agriculture.com/lack-of-rain-forecast-for-corn-belt-heightens-drought-fire-concerns-8723624"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 drought }}}\uc2  in the Corn belt, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cmegroup.com/openmarkets/agriculture/2024/For-Farmers-Lower-Grain-Prices-Could-be-Sign-of-Things-to-Come.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 low crop prices }}}\uc2 , and China moving away from its once-longstanding dependency on US corn and soybeans has many {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://missouriindependent.com/2024/09/30/farmers-struggle-with-bleak-situation-as-congress-waffles-on-new-farm-bill/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 American farmers on their knees }}}\uc2 . The number of US farms fell by 141,000 between 2017 and 2022, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.fb.org/news-release/new-census-shows-alarming-loss-of-family-farms"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 according to }}}\uc2 US Department of Agriculture\uc2  census data.\par \par \uc2 Despite his threats and bluster, farmers see Trump as a bulwark against a progressive environmental movement that, some of them say, has created major problems for agriculture without providing solutions.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe emissions issue has raised the cost of all of our equipment to ridiculous levels,\u8221\'20\'1D says Barcellos, a third-generation farmer.\par \par \uc2 He says the same model of hauling truck he bought five years ago is $100,000 more expensive to buy today. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/companies-are-balking-at-the-high-costs-of-running-electric-trucks-fed0ce6e"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Some reports suggest }}}\uc2  that running electric big rigs costs as much as twice that of diesel equivalents. Last year the \uc2 California Air Resources Board{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://calmatters.org/environment/2023/04/california-phases-out-diesel-trucks/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 voted to ban }}}\uc2  sales of new diesel trucks by 2036.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI can\u8217\'20\'19t afford an electric truck. Period,\u8221\'20\'1D says Barcellos.\par \par \uc2 On the tariffs front, many farmers believe Trump will ultimately have their back. Although his previous tariffs war cost American agriculture around $27bn in 2018 and 2019, Trump then reportedly {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.politico.com/news/2020/07/14/donald-trump-coronavirus-farmer-bailouts-359932"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 gave farmers record handouts worth $32bn }}}\uc2  in direct farming aid to counter the effects. Should Trump reignite his trade war next year, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.farmprogress.com/farm-policy/will-trump-tariffs-benefit-agriculture-trade-"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 some observers believe }}}\uc2  similar efforts may again be in the offing.\par \par \uc2 But others believe that Trump\u8217\'20\'19s anticipated efforts to impose tariffs on foreign goods may not have the same effect as previously.\par \par \uc2 With China no longer as dependent on US corn and soybeans \u8211\'20\'13 America\u8217\'20\'19s top two export commodities \u8211\'20\'13 as it was during Trump\u8217\'20\'19s first trade war, industry specialists say China is better prepared and instead worry that a new trade war could hit US farmers over the long term.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWhile it\u8217\'20\'19s possible to divert exports to other nations, there is not enough demand from the rest of the world to offset the major loss of soybean exports to China,\u8221\'20\'1D {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://ncga.com/stay-informed/media/the-corn-economy/article/2024/10/trade-study-how-potential-new-tariffs-could-impact-u-s-soybeans-and-corn"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 an October report }}}\uc2  by the \uc2 National Corn Growers Association\uc2  found.\par \par \uc2 Others wonder if sending checks to farmers to offset potential income losses is sustainable.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CTariffs and comprehensive deportations will affect the economy and mean that it\u8217\'20\'19s going to be worse for the grain markets, domestic food production and processing, plus the national debt than what has happened under the Democrats,\u8221\'20\'1D says Bill Wiley, a farmer in Shelby county, Ohio, who hires a small number of Nicaraguan workers to harvest gourds and pumpkins at his farm every fall through the H-2A agricultural visa program.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CAll of that should be turning off farmers.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 While Harris carried her home state of California handily, in Barcellos\u8217\'20\'19 largely agricultural Tulare county, just 200 miles from Oakland, her hometown, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://electionresults.sos.ca.gov/returns/president/county/tulare"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Trump won by more than 20% }}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Not all farmers, Wiley included, voted for Trump, and given the president-elect\u8217\'20\'19s apparent threats to agriculture and food production, he\u8217\'20\'19s at a loss to explain why many farmers would.\par \par \uc2 Either way, what happens once Trump takes office next month is likely to affect millions of people.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIf we assume that half of our agricultural workforce is undocumented, we can safely say that the best-case scenario for mass deportations is that American food production and supply is cut in half,\u8221\'20\'1D says James O\u8217\'20\'19Neill of the American Business Immigration Coalition. Around 45%, or 1 million, of US agricultural workers are undocumented.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe need legislation that legalizes the hardworking farm workers we already rely on \u8211\'20\'13 those with no criminal records, who have shown their commitment to the US and to American farmers.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Barcellos, who also serves as president of the Lower Tule River irrigation district, maintains that a host of Democratic policies and laws are hurting agriculture.\par \par \uc2 Rather than helping immigrant workers, he believes that California\u8217\'20\'19s $15.50 minimum wage for farmer workers and $19.75 an hour for H-2A workers is instead hastening the industry\u8217\'20\'19s move towards mechanization, \u8220\'20\'1Cand the workers hate that\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CCalifornia is forcing the hand of mechanization where they are trying to stop equipment from running because of the emissions they produce,\u8221\'20\'1D he says.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe are run by the coastal cities. We don\u8217\'20\'19t have a fighting chance.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020241207ekc7001p6\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
