\par\par \uc2 Business\par \b \uc2 Boeing\uc2  CEO promises \u8216\'20\'18fundamental\u8217\'20\'19 culture shift as strike vote begins\b0\par\par\uc2 Callum Jones \par \uc2 680 \uc2 words\par \uc2 7 November 2024\par 15:14 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2024.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Kelly Ortberg\uc2  reports $6bn quarterly loss at beleaguered planemaker amid worker strike that has entered fifth week\par \par \uc2 The new boss of \uc2 Boeing\uc2  has pledged to \u8220\'20\'1Cfundamentally\u8221\'20\'1D transform the culture inside the beleaguered aerospace giant, as its quarterly losses swelled to almost $6bn amid a sweeping strike.\par \par \uc2 As thousands of workers vote on a new contract on Wednesday, raising the prospect of an end to the crippling industrial action {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/business/2024/sep/13/boeing-union-strike"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 which began almost six weeks ago}}}\uc2 , \uc2 Boeing\uc2  revealed the extent of the damage of a dire year on its business.\par \par \uc2 Core operating losses at the US firm rose to $5.99bn in the three months leading up to 30 September, up from $1.09bn in the same period last year. Revenues slipped 1% to $17.8bn.\par \par \uc2 Kelly Ortberg\uc2 , \uc2 Boeing\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s CEO, outlined three key challenges it faces after {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/business/2024/feb/01/boeing-manager-737-max"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 high-profile safety crises}}}\uc2  and operational troubles: trust in the company has \u8220\'20\'1Ceroded\u8221\'20\'1D, it has too much debt, and \u8220\'20\'1Cserious lapses\u8221\'20\'1D in performance have disappointed customers, he said.\par \par \uc2 About 33,000 \uc2 Boeing\uc2  workers in Washington and Oregon went on strike last month, halting production of the company\u8217\'20\'19s 737 Max, 767 and 777 jets amid a standoff over pay. A proposed deal \u8211\'20\'13 including a 35% wage increase \u8211\'20\'13 has been {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/business/2024/oct/19/boeing-strike-vote-pay-raise"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 put to a vote}}}\uc2 , sparking hope that an end is in sight.\par \par \uc2 The vote comes amid a tough year for \uc2 Boeing\uc2 . January\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/jan/06/alaska-airlines-grounds-boeing-737-max-9-planes-after-mid-air-window-blowout"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 cabin panel blowout}}}\uc2  during a flight of a brand new Max jet sparked a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/business/article/2024/jun/18/boeing-ceo-dave-calhoun-senate-hearing"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 fresh crisis}}}\uc2  surrounding the safety and quality of its planes, as the group scrambled to tackle the concerns of regulators, airlines and passengers.\par \par \uc2 The company\u8217\'20\'19s defense business has also been under pressure, and a mission involving its Starliner spacecraft \u8211\'20\'13 which {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/science/article/2024/sep/06/boeing-starliner-iss"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 landed back on Earth in September}}}\uc2  without the two astronauts it carried to the International Space Station \u8211\'20\'13 raised questions about \uc2 Boeing\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s troubled space business.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThis is a big ship that will take some time to turn, but when it does, it has the capacity to be great again,\u8221\'20\'1D Ortberg told \uc2 Boeing\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s employees and shareholders on Wednesday. While pointing to potential opportunities for the firm, with a vast backlog of orders, he made clear that navigating its current woes would require a vast overhaul.\par \par \uc2 Executives need to be \u8220\'20\'1Cclosely integrated\u8221\'20\'1D with what is happening on the ground, he suggested. \u8220\'20\'1CWe need to be on the factory floors, in the back shops and in our engineering labs,\u8221\'20\'1D he wrote in a memo. \u8220\'20\'1CWe need to know what\u8217\'20\'19s going on, not only with our products, but with our people.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CAnd most importantly, we need to prevent the festering of issues and work better together to identify, fix, and understand root cause.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 As \uc2 Boeing\uc2  continues to grapple with heightened scrutiny, Ortberg invited workers and investors to judge him by the results of his measures, rather than his intentions, vowing to be \u8220\'20\'1Crelentless\u8221\'20\'1D in shifting the \uc2 Boeing\uc2  culture \u8220\'20\'1Cthrough action, not just words on a page\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Boeing\uc2  workers represented by the International Association of Machinists, based in Washington state and Oregon, were scheduled to vote on the proposed new four-year contract on Wednesday until 5pm.\par \par \uc2 Ortberg expressed optimism that they would approval the deal. \u8220\'20\'1CI remain committed to getting the team back and improving our relationship, so we don\u8217\'20\'19t become so disconnected in the future,\u8221\'20\'1D he said. \u8220\'20\'1CI\u8217\'20\'19m very hopeful that the package we put forward will allow our employees to come back to work so we can immediately focus on restoring the company.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 A vote of approval would only be the start, however \u8211\'20\'13 \u8220\'20\'1Cit\u8217\'20\'19s much harder to turn this on than it is to turn it off,\u8221\'20\'1D Ortberg noted \u8211\'20\'13 and the company still has a long way to go. \u8220\'20\'1CThis includes stabilizing our business, improving execution on the development programs, streamlining the portfolio to do what we do well and restoring the balance sheet so that we do have a path to the next commercial aircraft,\u8221\'20\'1D he said.\par \par \uc2 Shares in \uc2 Boeing\uc2  dropped over 1% during early trading in New York on Wednesday.\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020241107ekb7002s9\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
