\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 \u8216\'20\'18We are not defeated\u8217\'20\'19: US labor unions react to Harris election loss\b0\par\par\uc2 Michael Sainato \par \uc2 921 \uc2 words\par \uc2 6 November 2024\par 19:05 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2024.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 AFL-CIO\uc2  said unions spoke to most voters in federation history and saw gains such as minimum wage raises\par \par \uc2 A majority of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/us-unions"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 union }}}\uc2  members voted for {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/kamala-harris"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Kamala Harris }}}\uc2  in Tuesday\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/us-elections-2024"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 election }}}\uc2 , outpacing 2020 numbers. It didn\u8217\'20\'19t stop {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/donaldtrump"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Donald Trump }}}\uc2  from securing the presidency.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CHarris is outperforming 2020 numbers with union members, according to AP Votecast exit data. She\u8217\'20\'19s up 57-39, which tracks with our internal data. Union voters turned out for Harris, that much is crystal clear,\u8221\'20\'1D {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/ssmith_calabor/status/1853990113706950869"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 posted }}}\uc2  Steve Smith, deputy director of public affairs at the largest federation of unions in the US, \uc2 AFL-CIO\uc2 , on X.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 AFL-CIO{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.politico.com/news/2024/10/31/kamala-harris-campaign-union-volunteers-00186286"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reported }}}\uc2  that unions spoke to 3 million voters in the lead-up to the election, the most in the federation\u8217\'20\'19s history.\par \par \uc2 Several US labor unions launched {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/oct/27/election-harris-unions-swing-states"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 door-knocking operations }}}\uc2  on behalf of the Harris campaign in swing states. But while Harris purportedly saw an increase in support from union members, her support among low-income Americans {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/JStein_WaPo/status/1854168624119877887"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 decreased }}}\uc2  compared with Biden\u8217\'20\'19s in 2020, losing gains with voters making less than $50,000 in annual income and losing voters with incomes between $50,000 to $100,000 after Biden won this segment of the electorate in 2020.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 United Auto Workers{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://uaw-newsroom.prgloo.com/press-release/uaw-mounts-largest-electoral-engagement-program-in-decades-to-beat-back-billionaire-class"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ran }}}\uc2  one of its largest get-out-the-vote campaigns in recent history. \uc2 Unite Here\uc2 , which represents about 300,000 hospitality workers, knocked on {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://unitehere.org/press-releases/more-unite-here-canvassers-than-ever-knocked-on-the-largest-number-of-doors-in-our-history/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 over 4m doors }}}\uc2  in an operation supporting Harris in 10 divided states.\par \par \uc2 While the Harris campaign received endorsements from the majority of US labor unions, the Teamsters International {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/sep/18/election-teamsters-endorsement-harris-trump"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 withheld }}}\uc2  an endorsement this election cycle.\par \par \uc2 US labor unions and worker advocacy groups issued statements on Wednesday expressing disappointment in the result, while reaffirming their intention to continue to advocate for and defend pro-labor policies as Trump prepares to take office with a Republican {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/nov/06/senate-elections-republicans-win"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 majority }}}\uc2  in the Senate \u8211\'20\'13 the House results {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/nov/05/house-representatives-elections"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 remain outstanding }}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CRegardless of the political landscape, we will continue to speak truthfully about the conditions that foster real economic growth and equality, and we will press forward with policies that empower all workers, protect the most vulnerable, and hold corporations accountable for their impact on our economy and society,\u8221\'20\'1D said \uc2 Rebecca Dixon\uc2 , president and CEO of the National Employment Law Project.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1C We are not defeated, we are determined. And we won\u8217\'20\'19t back down. We remain united to each other and to our vision for a healthy, joyful and prosperous future. And we\u8217\'20\'19re not going to let anyone divide us based on racism, sexism or fear,\u8221\'20\'1D April Verrett, president of \uc2 Service Employees International Union\uc2  (\uc2 SEIU\uc2 ) said.\par \par \uc2 The union {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.seiu.org/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 represents }}}\uc2  about 2 million workers in the US and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.nytimes.com/2024/03/13/us/politics/seiu-biden-democrats.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ran a $200m }}}\uc2  election campaign supporting Harris and down-ballot candidates.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1COur call was to rally a strong, multiracial voting bloc, and that\u8217\'20\'19s what we did. We worked tirelessly, despite the voter suppression and structural barriers that have come to define our political system. And I\u8217\'20\'19ll be honest, today is hard, but I\u8217\'20\'19m holding on to hope,\u8221\'20\'1D Jessica Bolmer, a home care worker in Illinois and \uc2 SEIU\uc2  member, said in a statement to union members.\par \par \uc2 UMAW will continue to fight for equity, fair pay, and dignity for ALL workers, including musicians. With your help, we will continue to build collective power, win campaigns, protect marginalized workers, and encourage solidarity across the music industry. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/yLik48UV7M"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/yLik48UV7M }}}\uc2  \u8212\'20\'14 United Musicians and Allied Workers (@UMAW_) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/UMAW_/status/1854201124556796294?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 November 6, 2024 }}}\par \par \uc2 Some labor unions issued congratulations to Trump on the win while supporting bipartisan efforts to back their policy efforts.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CCongratulations to President-elect Trump. \uc2 ALPA\uc2  stands ready to work with the president-elect and the newly elected Congress on continuing our country\u8217\'20\'19s important efforts to keep flying safe and advancing the piloting profession,\u8221\'20\'1D the \uc2 Air Line Pilots Association\uc2 , which {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.alpa.org/about-alpa/what-we-do"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 represents }}}\uc2  about 78,000 pilots in the US and Canada, said in a statement. \u8220\'20\'1C\uc2 ALPA\uc2  is proud of our pilot-partisan agenda that focuses on education about \uc2 ALPA\uc2  issues and building relationships on both sides of the aisle in order to improve the lives of pilots and advance aviation safety.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Labor unions did see some gains. Unions {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://gallegoforarizona.com/endorsements/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 backed }}}\uc2  the Arizona US Senate candidate Ruben Gallego, who {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.nytimes.com/interactive/2024/11/05/us/elections/results-arizona-us-senate.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 outperformed }}}\uc2  Harris in the state and is {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/ng-interactive/2024/nov/05/us-senate-house-and-governor-elections-2024-results-from-all-50-states"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 currently leading }}}\uc2  as results are still being tallied. But the Ohio senator \uc2 Sherrod Brown{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/nov/05/election-ohio-senate-race-results"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 lost his bid }}}\uc2  for re-election {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.huffpost.com/entry/sherrod-brown-ohio-bernie-moreno-senate_n_67115616e4b0e33eefb22cd1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 despite }}}\uc2  strong union backing.\par \par \uc2 In Missouri, voters {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.kansascity.com/news/politics-government/article294530839.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 approved }}}\uc2  a union-backed ballot initiative to raise the state\u8217\'20\'19s minimum wage to $15 an hour by January 2026, and provide paid sick leave to workers at large employers. And voters in Alaska {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.reuters.com/world/us/us-state-ballot-proposals-minimum-wage-hikes-face-mixed-results-2024-11-06/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 approved }}}\uc2  a ballot measure to increase the state minimum wage to $15 an hour by 2027, though a ballot initiative in California to raise the minimum wage to $18 an hour is expected to come up short.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThis victory wouldn\u8217\'20\'19t have been possible without over a decade of low-wage workers organizing for $15 and a union. Many of us have been in this fight together for years, on the strike line and in the streets,\u8221\'20\'1D said Fran Marion, a fast-food worker in Kansas City, Missouri, and a longtime organizer with Fight for $15 and Fight for a Union.\par \par \uc2 Read more of the Guardian\u8217\'20\'19s 2024 US election coverage\par \par \uc2 *\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/nov/06/how-trump-won-us-election-president"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Trump wins the presidency \u8211\'20\'13 how did it happen? }}}\par \par \uc2 *\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/ng-interactive/2024/nov/06/us-election-results-map-2024-live-donald-trump-kamala-harris-president"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Full presidential election results and map }}}\par \par \uc2 *\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/ng-interactive/2024/nov/05/abortion-ballot-results-tracker-ban-states"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Abortion ballot measure results by state }}}\par \par \uc2 *\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/nov/06/senate-elections-republicans-win"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Republicans retake control of the Senate }}}\par \par \uc2 *\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/ng-interactive/2024/nov/05/us-senate-house-and-governor-elections-2024-results-from-all-50-states"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Senate, House and governor results }}}\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020241106ekb6002v1\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
