\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 Musk\u8217\'20\'19s get-out-the-vote workers didn\u8217\'20\'19t know they were canvassing for Trump \u8211\'20\'13 report\b0\par\par\uc2 Robert Tait in Washington \par \uc2 722 \uc2 words\par \uc2 31 October 2024\par 17:43 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2024.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Canvassers discovered they were working to drum up turnout for Trump after signing non-disclosure agreementsUS elections 2024 \u8211\'20\'13 live updates\par \par \uc2 Elon Musk\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s get-out-the-vote effort for \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  has come under renewed scrutiny after paid canvassers reported not knowing beforehand that they were being hired to support the former president.\par \par \uc2 Workers recruited by Musk\u8217\'20\'19s America Pac to canvass in the battleground state of Michigan only discovered they were working for the Space X and \uc2 Tesla\uc2  entrepreneur to drum up voter turnout for Trump after signing non-disclosure agreements, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wired.com/story/elon-musk-america-pac-blitz-canvassing-michigan-uhaul/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Wired reported}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI knew nothing of the job, or much of the job description, other than going door to door and asking the voters who are they voting for,\u8221\'20\'1D a canvasser who was flown to Michigan from another state told the website. \u8220\'20\'1CThen, after I signed over an NDA, is when I found out we are for Republicans and with Trump.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The canvassers also said they faced threats to their working conditions if they failed to meet stringent door-knocking targets.\par \par \uc2 The disclosure comes after {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/oct/19/trump-campaign-leaked-data-voters-elon-musk"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 the Guardian revealed serious question marks}}}\uc2  about Musk\u8217\'20\'19s voter turnout effort in Nevada and Arizona amid reports that up to 25% of reported door knocks in the state could be fraudulent.\par \par \uc2 The Michigan canvassers were hired by Blitz Canvassing, a subcontractor that has so far been paid about $9m by Musk\u8217\'20\'19s Pac to oversee his ground operation aimed at generating turnout in the state.\par \par \uc2 Recruits reported being told to knock on 1,000 doors a week and to achieve a 17-22% engagement rate \u8211\'20\'13 considered a high benchmark for householders opening the door to strangers \u8211\'20\'13 to avoid having to pay for their own accommodation and flights home.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWhat\u8217\'20\'19s gonna happen is, they\u8217\'20\'19re gonna stop paying for these [motel] rooms, and then you\u8217\'20\'19re gonna end up having to pay for it yourself,\u8221\'20\'1D a manager is heard saying in a recording obtained by Wired. \u8220\'20\'1CYou can\u8217\'20\'19t do that with no money.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The canvassers also reported being driven to neighbourhoods to carry out door-knocking expeditions in the back of a U-Haul van without seat beats, rather than in rental cars, as had been promised. They were dropped off 40 minutes apart to go on door-knocking beats.\par \par \uc2 None of the workers featured in the report had valid driver\u8217\'20\'19s licenses.\par \par \uc2 A video purportedly shot from inside a van showed mostly Black workers separated from the driver by a cage-like structure. The driver was recorded as telling the workers that he was in pain and having difficulty driving.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI just had surgery, bro,\u8221\'20\'1D the U-Haul driver told the canvassers. \u8220\'20\'1CLike half of my foot is cut off.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 One door-knocker said he only learned he was working for Musk\u8217\'20\'19s Pac when he heard supervisors mention the billionaire\u8217\'20\'19s name.\par \par \uc2 The canvassers were also told to keep the GPS apps on their mobile phones on at all times amid reports that America Pac\u8217\'20\'19s Campaign Sidekick app lacks an effective geo-locator function.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Don\u8217\'20\'19t miss important US election coverage. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://app.adjust.com/w4u7jx3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Get our free app}}}\uc2  and sign up for election alerts\par \par \uc2 Neither Blitz Canvassing nor America Pac have commented.\par \par \uc2 The latest revelation appears to further highlight the risks of Trump outsourcing the bulk of the task of motivating potential voters to Musk\u8217\'20\'19s Pac in battleground states where he and \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2  are running neck and neck in the polls.\par \par \uc2 The billionaire\u8217\'20\'19s operation has come under fire in Pennsylvania, where {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/technology/2024/oct/30/elon-musk-court-america-pac"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2  a judge has summoned him to appear in court }}}\uc2  over a lawsuit challenging the legality of his offer of $1m giveaways to registered voters who sign his petition on free speech. Several $1m awards have already been given to people in the state, generally deemed the most important battleground in next week\u8217\'20\'19s election given its 19 electoral college votes, the most of any swing state.\par \par \uc2 At a time when voters have listed the economy as their primary concern, Musk has also drawn attention by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnn.com/2024/10/30/politics/donald-trump-government-what-matters/index.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 warning}}}\uc2  just before polling day that ordinary Americans will face \u8220\'20\'1Ctemporary hardships\u8221\'20\'1D under the $2tn budget cut he envisions implementing in an anticipated role overseeing public spending, which {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnn.com/2024/10/30/politics/donald-trump-government-what-matters/index.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Trump has promised him}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020241031ekav002bj\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
