\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 Hurricane Helene: Harris to travel to Georgia to survey storm impact \u8211\'20\'13 as it happened\b0\par\par\uc2 Maya Yang (now); Anna Betts and Yohannes Lowe (earlier) \par \uc2 5,421 \uc2 words\par \uc2 1 October 2024\par 22:02 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2024.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 This live blog is now closed. For the latest on US politics, you can see full coverage here.\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 9.54pm BST\par \par \uc2 Closing summary\par \par \uc2 Here is a wrap-up of the day\u8217\'20\'19s key events:\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2  will travel to Georgia to survey the impacts of Hurricane Helene on Wednesday, her office announced. Harris will receive an on-the-ground briefing and will also provide updates on federal actions that are being taken to support emergency response and recovery efforts in Georgia and other impacted states in the southeast.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 The White House said on Tuesday that president \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2  will be traveling to North Carolina and South Carolina on Wednesday. Biden will take an aerial tour of areas impacted by Hurricane Helene in western North Carolina, receive operational briefings, and greet with first responders and local officials, the White House said in an announcement.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 The federal government has delivered more than 2.6 million ready-to-eat meals and more than 1 million liters of water, homeland security secretary Alejandro Mayorkas said. \u8220\'20\'1CAt its peak, there were 5.1 million customers without power \u8230\'20\'26 we\u8217\'20\'19ve reduced that number of customers without power by 3.8 million people,\u8221\'20\'1D he added.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Xavier Becerra\uc2 , the US health and human services secretary, has declared a public health emergency for South Carolina and Tennessee to address the health impacts of Hurricane Helene. \u8220\'20\'1CWe will do all we can to help officials in South Carolina and Tennessee respond to the health impacts of Hurricane Helene,\u8221\'20\'1D Becerra {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.hhs.gov/about/news/2024/09/30/hhs-secretary-xavier-becerra-declares-public-health-emergency-south-carolina-tennessee-hurricane-helene.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said in an announcement}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 The justice department has launched its first federal investigation of the Tulsa Race Massacre. On Monday, assistant attorney general \uc2 Kristen Clarke\uc2  announced the opening of the investigation under the Emmett Till Unsolved Civil Rights Crime Act.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Here is \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.whitehouse.gov/briefing-room/statements-releases/2024/10/01/statement-from-president-joe-biden-on-the-negotiations-between-usmx-and-the-international-longshoremens-association/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 statement}}}\uc2  on the negotiations between United States Maritime Alliance and the \uc2 International Longshoremen\u8217\'20\'19s Association\uc2 : \u8220\'20\'1CNow is not the time for ocean carriers to refuse to negotiate a fair wage for these essential workers while raking in record profits. My administration will be monitoring for any price gouging activity that benefits foreign ocean carriers, including those on the USMX board.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 A new survey from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.aarp.org/pri/topics/voter-research/politics/pennsylvania-older-voter-survey-2024/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AARP}}}\uc2  published on Tuesday has vice-president \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2  leading \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  50% to 47% among likely voters in the battleground state of Pennsylvania. The survey, conducted between the 14th and 24th of September, also showed a significant gender gap, with Harris ahead by 19 percentage points among female voters and Trump leading by 16 points with male voters.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Jimmy Carter\uc2 , a Democrat who served in the White House between 1977 and 1981, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/sep/18/jimmy-carter-100th-birthday-party-fox-theatre"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 celebrates his 100th birthday today}}}\uc2 , making him the first US president to reach the milestone. Carter, who has suffered from health issues, including a melanoma that spread to his liver and brain, has been in hospice care at home in Plains, Georgia, since February 2023.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Democratic US vice-president \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2  and former Republican president \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  are expected to watch the VP debate tonight. Trump has said he would offer a play-by-play commentary of the event on social media.\par \par \uc2 block-time updated-timeUpdated at 11.00pm BST\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 9.12pm BST\par \par \uc2 Here are some of the latest images coming through the newswires of Hurricane Helene:\par \par \uc2 block-time updated-timeUpdated at 9.50pm BST\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 8.36pm BST\par \par \uc2 Biden on USMX and ILA negotiations: 'Now is not the time for ocean carriers to refuse to negotiate a fair wage'\par \par \uc2 Here is \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.whitehouse.gov/briefing-room/statements-releases/2024/10/01/statement-from-president-joe-biden-on-the-negotiations-between-usmx-and-the-international-longshoremens-association/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 statement}}}\uc2  on the negotiations between United States Maritime Alliance and the \uc2 International Longshoremen\u8217\'20\'19s Association\uc2 :\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CCollective bargaining is the best way for workers to get the pay and benefits they deserve. I have urged USMX, which represents a group of foreign-owned carriers, to come to the table and present a fair offer to the workers of the \uc2 International Longshoremen\u8217\'20\'19s Association\uc2  that ensures they are paid appropriately in line with their invaluable contributions.\par \par \uc2 Ocean carriers have made record profits since the pandemic and in some cases profits grew in excess of 800 percent compared to their profits prior to the pandemic. Executive compensation has grown in line with those profits and profits have been returned to shareholders at record rates. It\u8217\'20\'19s only fair that workers, who put themselves at risk during the pandemic to keep ports open, see a meaningful increase in their wages as well.\par \par \uc2 As our nation climbs out of the aftermath of Hurricane Helene, dockworkers will play an essential role in getting communities the resources they need. Now is not the time for ocean carriers to refuse to negotiate a fair wage for these essential workers while raking in record profits. My administration will be monitoring for any price gouging activity that benefits foreign ocean carriers, including those on the USMX board.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 block-time updated-timeUpdated at 8.38pm BST\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 8.10pm BST\par \par \uc2 The federal government has delivered more than 2.6 million ready-to-eat meals and more than 1 million liters of water, homeland security secretary Alejandro Mayorkas said.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CAt its peak, there were 5.1 million customers without power \u8230\'20\'26 we\u8217\'20\'19ve reduced that number of customers without power by 3.8 million people,\u8221\'20\'1D he added.\par \par \uc2 In response to a question about communities on the ground that have been badly affected by Hurricane Helene and feel that the government is not doing enough, Mayorkas said: \u8220\'20\'1CWe are there, and we will continue to be there, and we will reach the most difficult to access locations. We are relentless in our efforts to ensure the safety and security of all.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 More than 100 people have been killed by Hurricane Helene across multiple states in recent days.\par \par \uc2 block-time updated-timeUpdated at 8.19pm BST\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 8.05pm BST\par \par \uc2 Homeland security secretary Alejandro Mayorkas is giving an update on Hurricane Helene.\par \par \uc2 During the White House press briefing, Mayorkas said, \u8220\'20\'1CHurricane Helene is of a historic magnitude, this many states hit this hard, the wind field of the hurricane stretched 350 miles from its center."\par \par \uc2 He added, \u8220\'20\'1CWe are in different phases of a post hurricane environment, depending on the state and the location within the state. In some areas, we are still in search and recovery, search and rescue operations. And others, we are in the response and recovery phase.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 7.49pm BST\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 Federal Emergency Management Agency\uc2  has made federal assistance available to Georgia residents in 30 additional counties to help those impacted by Hurricane Helene.\par \par \uc2 In a news release issued on Tuesday, Fema said:\par \par \uc2 Individuals in Atkinson, Bacon, Ben Hill, Berrien, Bulloch, Burke, Candler, Chatham, Clinch, Colquitt, Cook, Echols, Emanuel, Evans, Glascock, Irwin, Jeff Davis, Jenkins, Johnson, Lanier, Laurens, Lincoln, McDuffie, Montgomery, Screven, Telfair, Treutlen, Ware, Washington and Wheeler counties may be eligible for grants for temporary housing and home repairs, low-cost loans to cover uninsured property losses and other programs to help them recover from the effects of the disaster.\par \par \uc2 According to Fema, in addition to housing expenses, survivors may be eligible for other serious disaster-related needs such as replacement of damaged personal property and expenses for transportation, childcare, moving and storage.\par \par \uc2 block-time updated-timeUpdated at 7.51pm BST\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 7.26pm BST\par \par \uc2 Republicans in Nevada are dismissing an effigy of a nude \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  as \u8220\'20\'1Cdeplorable \u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 The Guardian\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s Edward Helmore reports:\par \par \uc2 A 43ft (13 meters) effigy of an entirely nude {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/donaldtrump"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Donald Trump}}}\uc2  on the interstate from Las Vegas to Reno, Nevada, has been dismissed as \u8220\'20\'1Cdeplorable\u8221\'20\'1D and \u8220\'20\'1Cpornographic\u8221\'20\'1D by Republicans in the state.\par \par \uc2 In a statement, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.telegraph.co.uk/us/politics/2024/02/07/nevada-republic-primary-result-nikki-haley-none-candidates/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Nevada Republican party}}}\uc2  said it \u8220\'20\'1Cstrongly condemns\u8221\'20\'1D the effigy of the former president, which hangs from a crane, weighs 6,000lbs, is made from foam and rebar, is titled Crooked and Obscene and is expected to be brought to other cities as part of a nationwide tour.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWhile families drive through Las Vegas, they are forced to view this offensive marionette, designed intentionally for shock value rather than meaningful dialogue,\u8221\'20\'1D said the party\u8217\'20\'19s statement, invoking the name of a city that was essentially founded to capitalize on gambling and sex.\par \par \uc2 The artists behind the graphic effigy \u8211\'20\'13 who want to remain anonymous \u8211\'20\'13 told {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://newrepublic.com/post/186544/maga-political-violence-reaction-nude-trump-statue"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 the Wrap}}}\uc2  that Trump\u8217\'20\'19s nudity was \u8220\'20\'1Cintentional, serving as a bold statement on transparency, vulnerability and the public personas of political figures\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 For the full story, clicl here:\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/oct/01/naked-trump-statue-nevada-republicans"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Nevada Republicans dismiss 43ft nude Trump effigy as \u8216\'20\'18deplorable\u8217\'20\'19}}}\par \par \uc2 block-time updated-timeUpdated at 7.32pm BST\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 6.58pm BST\par \par \uc2 Harris to travel to Georgia on Wednesday\par \par \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2  will travel to Georgia to survey the impacts of Hurricane Helene on Wednesday, her office announced.\par \par \uc2 Harris will receive an on-the-ground briefing and will also provide updates on federal actions that are being taken to support emergency response and recovery efforts in Georgia and other impacted states in the southeast.\par \par \uc2 As of Monday, at least 15 people in Georgia have been killed by Hurricane Helene, including a first responder, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://dailymontanan.com/2024/09/30/death-toll-in-georgia-reaches-15-as-recovery-efforts-begin-in-wake-of-helene/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 according to }}}\uc2  local outlets.\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 6.27pm BST\par \par \uc2 The justice department has launched its first federal investigation of the Tulsa Race Massacre.\par \par \uc2 On Monday, assistant attorney general \uc2 Kristen Clarke\uc2  announced the opening of the investigation under the Emmett Till Unsolved Civil Rights Crime Act.\par \par \uc2 Under the act, the federal government is able to investigate civil and violent crimes committed before 1970.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe acknowledge descendants of the survivors, and the victims continue to bear the trauma of this act of racial terrorism,\u8221\'20\'1D Clarke said, the Associated Press reports, referring to the tragedy in 1921 where white supremacists killed around hundreds of residents in Oklahoma while destroying around 1,250 homes and businesses.\par \par \uc2 The event is largely considered one of the most horrific incidents of racial violence in the history of the US.\par \par \uc2 block-time updated-timeUpdated at 6.32pm BST\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 6.02pm BST\par \par \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2  has urged port operators to increase wages after 45,000 workers went on strike.\par \par \uc2 The Guardian\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s Michael Sainato reports:\par \par \uc2 Biden has urged port operators to give workers a \u8220\'20\'1Cmeaningful increase\u8221\'20\'1D in pay after tens of thousands went on strike, prompting some of the busiest ports in the US to brace for crippling disruption.\par \par \uc2 About 45,000 port workers represented by the \uc2 International Longshoremen\u8217\'20\'19s Association\uc2  (ILA) began walking off the job after their contracts expired at midnight, with 36 ports along the east and Gulf coasts affected. They typically handle about half of the nation\u8217\'20\'19s ocean shipping.\par \par \uc2 Talks over a new contract between the ILA and the United States Maritime Alliance (USMX) have broken down, and the union dismissed a last-ditch offer from operators hours before the strike was due to began.\par \par \uc2 Hours after the strike began, the White House issued a robust statement calling on USMX to negotiate a \u8220\'20\'1Cfair\u8221\'20\'1D contract that reflects \u8220\'20\'1Cthe substantial contribution\u8221\'20\'1D of ports workers to America\u8217\'20\'19s economy.\par \par \uc2 For more details, click here:\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/oct/01/us-port-workers-strike-ila-union"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Biden urges port operators to increase wages after 45,000 workers go on strike}}}\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 5.50pm BST\par \par \uc2 Biden to travel to North Carolina and South Carolina on Wednesday\par \par \uc2 The White House said on Tuesday that president \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2  will be traveling to North Carolina and South Carolina on Wednesday.\par \par \uc2 Biden will take an aerial tour of areas impacted by Hurricane Helene in western North Carolina, receive operational briefings, and greet with first responders and local officials, the White House said in an announcement.\par \par \uc2 block-time updated-timeUpdated at 6.50pm BST\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 5.47pm BST\par \par \uc2 The day so far\par \par \uc2 Good afternoon {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/us-politics"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 US politics}}}\uc2  readers.\par \par \uc2 We are hours away from the vice-presidential debate between \uc2 Tim Walz\uc2  and JD Vance, which will start at 9pm ET, and will be held in a studio without an audience.\par \par \uc2 Here\u8217\'20\'19s what else has happened today so far:\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Donald Trump{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/live/2024/oct/01/election-harris-trump-politics-updates?CMP=share_btn_url&page=with%3Ablock-66fbc9768f08937fb78e4fab#block-66fbc9768f08937fb78e4fab"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said }}}\uc2  that he will be offering a play-by-play commentary of the vice-presidential debate on social media.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 A new poll{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/live/2024/oct/01/election-harris-trump-politics-updates?CMP=share_btn_url&page=with%3Ablock-66fc05858f08dc8c162240dd#block-66fc05858f08dc8c162240dd"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2  found}}}\uc2  that a majority of voters want to hear from \uc2 Tim Walz\uc2  and JD Vance on immigration and economy during the debate tonight.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 President \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2  is continuing to monitor the devastation caused by Hurricane Helene. Biden {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/live/2024/oct/01/election-harris-trump-politics-updates?CMP=share_btn_url&page=with%3Ablock-66fbb2278f0894769732d5a8#block-66fbb2278f0894769732d5a8"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said }}}\uc2  that thousands of federal personnel are being deployed to help support search and rescue missions and remove debris from collapsed buildings.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Biden will be traveling to North Carolina and South Carolina on Wednesday, the White House said. The president will be taking an aerial tour of the areas impacted by Hurricane Helene, receive operational briefings, and meet with first responders and local officials.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 The Georgia hand-count trial, regarding a lawsuit filed by Democrats challenging two new rules passed by the Georgia state election board got {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/live/2024/oct/01/election-harris-trump-politics-updates?CMP=share_btn_url&page=with%3Ablock-66fbd0d78f08c8faba53a2eb#block-66fbd0d78f08c8faba53a2eb"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 under way this morning.}}}\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Former president \uc2 Jimmy Carter\uc2  is {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/sep/18/jimmy-carter-100th-birthday-party-fox-theatre"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 celebrating his 100th birthday}}}\uc2  today.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  is campaigning in the battleground state of Wisconsin on Tuesday.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Public health emergencies {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/live/2024/oct/01/election-harris-trump-politics-updates?CMP=share_btn_url&page=with%3Ablock-66fbff518f08dc8d9a9dda03#block-66fbff518f08dc8d9a9dda03"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 were declared }}}\uc2  for South Carolina and Tennessee over hurricane impact.\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 5.08pm BST\par \par \uc2 The death toll in South Carolina as a result of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/hurricane-helene"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Hurricane}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/hurricane-helene"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2  Helene}}}\uc2  has now risen to 33, according to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.live5news.com/2024/10/01/sc-death-toll-helene-rises-33/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 WCSC}}}\uc2 , quoting the state\u8217\'20\'19s department of public safety.\par \par \uc2 Before Tuesday morning, the death toll was at 29.\par \par \uc2 At least 133 deaths in six states in the south-east of the US have been attributed to Hurricane Helene so far, according to the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://apnews.com/article/hurricane-helene-north-carolina-asheville-f02869c7d01e68f2d7f0553abb82252f"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Associated Press}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 block-time updated-timeUpdated at 5.26pm BST\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 4.31pm BST\par \par \uc2 A new survey from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.aarp.org/pri/topics/voter-research/politics/pennsylvania-older-voter-survey-2024/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AARP}}}\uc2  published on Tuesday has vice-president \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2  leading \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  50% to 47% among likely voters in the battleground state of Pennsylvania.\par \par \uc2 The survey, conducted between the 14th and 24th of September, also showed a significant gender gap, with Harris ahead by 19 percentage points among female voters and Trump leading by 16 points with male voters.\par \par \uc2 The survey also found that Trump leads Harris by 8 points with voters 50 years old and older.\par \par \uc2 block-time updated-timeUpdated at 5.24pm BST\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 3.32pm BST\par \par \uc2 Majority of voters want to hear Walz and Vance views on immigration and economy \u8211\'20\'13 poll\par \par \uc2 A new {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cbsnews.com/news/vance-walz-debate-poll-cbs-news-poll/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CBS/YouGov}}}\uc2  poll released on Monday ahead of the vice-presidential debate tonight, found that both Democratic vice-presidential nominee \uc2 Tim Walz\uc2  and Republican vice-presidential nominee JD Vance are described as \u8220\'20\'1Ccompetent\u8221\'20\'1D by more than 50% of the registered voters surveyed.\par \par \uc2 In regards to the debate tonight, 86% of respondents said they wanted to hear from the candidates about the economy, and three-quarters said they wanted to hear the candidates\u8217\'20\'19 views on immigration.\par \par \uc2 block-time updated-timeUpdated at 5.25pm BST\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 3.00pm BST\par \par \uc2 Public health emergency declared for South Carolina and Tennessee over hurricane impact\par \par \uc2 Xavier Becerra\uc2 , the US health and human services secretary, has declared a public health emergency for South Carolina and Tennessee to address the health impacts of Hurricane Helene.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe will do all we can to help officials in South Carolina and Tennessee respond to the health impacts of Hurricane Helene,\u8221\'20\'1D Becerra {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.hhs.gov/about/news/2024/09/30/hhs-secretary-xavier-becerra-declares-public-health-emergency-south-carolina-tennessee-hurricane-helene.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said in an announcement}}}\uc2 . \u8220\'20\'1CWe are working closely with state and local health authorities, as well as with our partners across the federal government, and stand ready to provide additional public health and medical support.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Public health emergencies were also issued for {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://aspr.hhs.gov/legal/PHE/Pages/Fl-Hurricane-Helene-Sept2024.aspx"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Florida}}}\uc2 , {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://aspr.hhs.gov/legal/PHE/Pages/GA-Hurricane-Helene-Sept2024.aspx"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Georgia}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.whitehouse.gov/briefing-room/presidential-actions/2024/09/28/president-joseph-r-biden-jr-approves-north-carolina-disaster-declaration-3/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 North Carolina}}}\uc2  last week, as a result of the hurricane.\par \par \uc2 block-time updated-timeUpdated at 3.33pm BST\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 2.51pm BST\par \par \uc2 Lloyd Austin\uc2 , the US defense secretary, said on Tuesday morning that over the last several days, the \uc2 Department of Defense\uc2  had mobilized personnel and resources to support the ongoing disaster relief, rescue, and recovery efforts in the aftermath of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/hurricane-helene"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Hurricane Helene}}}\uc2  .\par \par \uc2 His {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/SecDef/status/1841107012135846229"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 statement}}}\uc2  continued:\par \par \uc2 I am grateful to the over 6,300 Guardsmen from over 12 states, \uc2 US Northern Command\uc2 , the \uc2 US Army Corps of Engineers\uc2 , and other DOD teammates who continue to work alongside federal, state, and local partners to provide assistance where it is needed most. We continue to stand by the people and communities of North Carolina and all those affected.\par \par \uc2 block-time updated-timeUpdated at 2.53pm BST\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 2.46pm BST\par \par \uc2 Trump campaigning in Wisconsin ahead of VP debate\par \par \uc2 Republican nominee \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  will be campaigning in the battleground state of Wisconsin on Tuesday, ahead of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/oct/01/watch-walz-vance-vice-presidential-debate-time"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 vice-presidential debate}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 One of his stops in Wisconsin today is in Dane county, a Democratic stronghold. The former president is scheduled to appear at a manufacturing facility in Waunakee.\par \par \uc2 According to the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://apnews.com/article/trump-harris-biden-wisconsin-debate-walz-vance-60307f1fa8530c60a7f7cde721260efc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Associated Press}}}\uc2 , Trump has never campaigned in Dane county before and did not visit the county when he was president.\par \par \uc2 Recent polls {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/article/2024/sep/09/latest-poll-kamala-harris-donald-trump-2024-us-election-presidential-polls"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 have shown}}}\uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2  and Trump neck and neck in Wisconsin, with Harris leading narrowly by one percentage point.\par \par \uc2 block-time updated-timeUpdated at 2.51pm BST\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 2.13pm BST\par \par \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2  \u8217\'20\'19s 2024 presidential campaign is launching a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oPk8d1jA34k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 new ad}}}\uc2  focused on healthcare, it said on Tuesday.\par \par \uc2 The ad features clips from the presidential debate between Harris and Republican nominee, \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 , last month, in which Trump discussed having a \u8220\'20\'1Cconcept of a plan\u8221\'20\'1D to replace the Affordable Care Act but did not give any details.\par \par \uc2 In the ad, Harris says that if elected, she will extend the price caps that \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2  has signed for seniors, such as the price cap on insulin at $35 a month and a cap on prescription drug costs to no more than $2,000 a year, to all Americans.\par \par \uc2 block-time updated-timeUpdated at 2.17pm BST\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 1.55pm BST\par \par \uc2 As of this morning, there are still more than 1 million homes and businesses without power across multiple states in the south-east of the US, from Florida to West Virginia, as the region continues to deal with the aftermath of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/hurricane-helene"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Hurricane Helene}}}\uc2  .\par \par \uc2 In South Carolina, more than 600,000 power outages are being recorded, according to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://poweroutage.us/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 PowerOutage.us}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 In Georgia and North Carolina, each state is recording over 450,000 power outages as of Tuesday morning.\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 1.28pm BST\par \par \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  is scheduled to hold a rally in Saginaw, Michigan, on Thursday at 3pm ET.\par \par \uc2 In 2016, the former president {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.saginawcounty.com/media/tb1pr5c4/2016-november-general-election-summary-report.pdf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 narrowly won}}}\uc2  Saginaw county, which sits around 100 miles north-west of Detroit and is home to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.census.gov/quickfacts/fact/table/saginawcountymichigan/POP010220"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 around 200,000}}}\uc2  people. However, in 2020, \uc2 Joe Biden{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.politico.com/2020-election/results/michigan/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 won}}}\uc2  the county.\par \par \uc2 A win for Trump in Saginaw and in the battleground state of Michigan in November would be a significant blow to \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2  \u8217\'20\'19s campaign.\par \par \uc2 Last year, Trump supporters in Saginaw led a takeover of the Republican party there, and packed the local party with delegates aligned with the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2022/jul/30/america-first-trumpism-beyond-trump"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 America First movement}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 You can read more about that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/oct/01/trump-shoppe-republicans-michigan-saginaw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 here}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/oct/01/trump-shoppe-republicans-michigan-saginaw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \u8216\'20\'18This man is everything\u8217\'20\'19: how devoted Trump supporters took over the Republican party in a Michigan city}}}\par \par \uc2 block-time updated-timeUpdated at 1.30pm BST\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 12.51pm BST\par \par \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2  and \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2  are closely monitoring the strike at the east coast and Gulf coast ports, the White House has said. Dockworkers on the two coasts began a strike earlier today, in effect halting the flow of about half the nation\u8217\'20\'19s ocean shipping after negotiations for a new labor contract broke down over wages.\par \par \uc2 As my colleague Michael Sainato {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/oct/01/us-port-workers-strike-ila-union"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 explains in this story}}}\uc2 , talks over a new contract between the \uc2 International Longshoremen\u8217\'20\'19s Association\uc2  and the United States Maritime Alliance have faltered, and the union dismissed a last-ditch offer from operators hours before the strike was due to begin.\par \par \uc2 Biden\u8217\'20\'19s administration \u8211\'20\'13 which has tried to forge close relations with trade unions \u8211\'20\'13 has repeatedly ruled out the use of federal powers to break a strike in the event of an impasse. Alex Gangitano, the White House correspondent for the Hill, said Biden has directed his team to reiterate his message to both sides that they need to negotiate terms \u8220\'20\'1Cat the table\u8221\'20\'1D fairly, quickly and in good faith.\par \par \uc2 enltrPer WH: President Biden & VP Harris are closely monitoring the strike at East Coast and Gulf Coast ports. The President has directed his team to convey his message directly to both sides that they need to be at the table and negotiating in good faith\u8212\'20\'14fairly and quickly.\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 AlexGangitano (@AlexGangitano) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/AlexGangitano/status/1841062390164578559?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 October 1, 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 block-time updated-timeUpdated at 1.01pm BST\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 12.37pm BST\par \par \uc2 Jimmy Carter\uc2  celebrates 100th birthday\par \par \uc2 Jimmy Carter\uc2 , a Democrat who served in the White House between 1977 and 1981, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/sep/18/jimmy-carter-100th-birthday-party-fox-theatre"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 celebrates his 100th birthday today}}}\uc2 , making him the first US president to reach the milestone. Carter, who has suffered from health issues, including a melanoma that spread to his liver and brain, has been in hospice care at home in Plains, Georgia, since February 2023. \u8220\'20\'1CI\u8217\'20\'19m only trying to make it to vote for \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2 \u8221\'20\'1D in November\u8217\'20\'19s election, he said, according to his grandson.\par \par \uc2 block-time updated-timeUpdated at 12.56pm BST\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 12.14pm BST\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/live/2024/oct/01/election-harris-trump-politics-updates?page=with:block-66fbb2278f0894769732d5a8#block-66fbb2278f0894769732d5a8"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 We reported in an earlier post}}}\uc2  about \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2 , the US president, issuing stark comments about the devastating impact of Hurricane Helene. \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  has said he has spoken to \uc2 Elon Musk\uc2  and would enlist the billionaire owner of X to help restore communications to communities ravaged by the hurricane.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe want to get Starlink hooked up, because they have no communication whatsoever,\u8221\'20\'1D Trump {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2024-09-30/trump-says-he-asked-musk-to-bring-starlink-to-helene-hit-towns?srnd=phx-election-2024&sref=Xl91GI8N"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 was quoted by Bloomberg}}}\uc2  as having said yesterday during a visit to Georgia, a state expected to be decisive in November\u8217\'20\'19s presidential election. The Harris campaign believes she has a chance to win Georgia, which Biden narrowly won in 2020.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThroughout the region, our hearts are with you, and we are going to be with you as long as you need it,\u8221\'20\'1D Trump said.\par \par \uc2 Georgia is the state with the second most power outages caused by the storm, according to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://poweroutage.us/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 PowerOutage.US}}}\uc2 , which estimates about 471,000 customers were without power as of 05.18ET on Tuesday morning.\par \par \uc2 Starlink \u8211\'20\'13 Musk\u8217\'20\'19s satellite network and the world\u8217\'20\'19s largest satellite operator \u8211\'20\'13 provides internet services via a huge network of satellites. It is typically aimed at people who live in remote areas who otherwise would not be able to get fast-speed internet connections.\par \par \uc2 He said that \uc2 SpaceX\uc2  has sent \u8220\'20\'1Cas many Starlink terminals as possible to help areas in need\u8221\'20\'1D of internet connection after Hurricane Helene, including those in North Carolina he says Trump alerted him to.\par \par \uc2 enltrSince the Hurricane Helene disaster, \uc2 SpaceX\uc2  has sent as many Starlink terminals as possible to help areas in need.\par \par \uc2 Earlier today, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/realDonaldTrump?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 @realDonaldTrump}}}\uc2  alerted me to additional people who need Starlink Internet in North Carolina. We are sending them terminals right away.\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 \uc2 Elon Musk\uc2  (@elonmusk) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/elonmusk/status/1840987806388179258?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 October 1, 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 block-time updated-timeUpdated at 12.23pm BST\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 11.52am BST\par \par \uc2 Georgia hand-count trial to get under way on Tuesday\par \par \uc2 A trial is set to get under way today on a lawsuit filed by Democrats challenging two new rules passed by the Georgia state election board that have to do with county certification of election results.\par \par \uc2 The Associated Press has the following report:\par \par \uc2 Supporters of the rules say they are necessary to ensure the accuracy of the vote totals before county election officials sign off on them. But critics say they worry that supporters of Republican presidential nominee \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  could use the rules to delay or deny certification if the former president loses the state to Democratic vice president \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2 , causing confusion and casting doubt on the results.\par \par \uc2 The lawsuit is to be decided in a bench trial, which means there\u8217\'20\'19s a judge but no jury, before Fulton county superior court judge Robert McBurney.\par \par \uc2 One of the rules provides a definition of certification that includes requiring county officials to conduct a \u8220\'20\'1Creasonable inquiry\u8221\'20\'1D before certifying results, but it does not specify what that means. The other includes language allowing county election officials \u8220\'20\'1Cto examine all election related documentation created during the conduct of elections\u8221\'20\'1D\u8230\'20\'26\par \par \uc2 The lawsuit was filed against the state election board, which is dominated by three Republican partisans whom Trump praised by name at a recent rally in Atlanta. The state and national Republican parties have joined the lawsuit on the side of the election board.\par \par \uc2 My colleague Sam Levine has more:\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/sep/30/democrats-georgia-election-hand-count-lawsuit"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Democrats sue Georgia election board over new ballot hand-count rule}}}\par \par \uc2 block-time updated-timeUpdated at 12.56pm BST\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 11.33am BST\par \par \uc2 Entire communities 'wiped out' by 'catastrophic' impact of Hurricane Helene, Biden says\par \par \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2  said entire communities have been \u8220\'20\'1Cwiped out\u8221\'20\'1D by the \u8220\'20\'1Ccatastrophic\u8221\'20\'1D impact of Hurricane Helene which has left about 600 people missing or unaccounted for, according to White House estimates.\par \par \uc2 In a video clip of Biden speaking with North Carolina governor, Roy Cooper, the US president said thousands of federal personnel are being deployed to help support search and rescue missions and remove debris from collapsed buildings.\par \par \uc2 The other priorities are getting cell networks back online and power restoration, Biden said, adding that recovery is \u8220\'20\'1Cgoing to take a while\u8221\'20\'1D as the destruction of roads poses a huge logistical challenge to relief efforts.\par \par \uc2 He said:\par \par \uc2 I want to express condolences to all the families, to all the families whose loved ones have died or are missing.\par \par \uc2 Matter of fact, it\u8217\'20\'19s almost equally as bad missing, not knowing whether or not your brother or sister, husband, wife, son or daughter are alive.\par \par \uc2 And to the survivors, I want you to know the administration is going to be there til we finish the job.\par \par \uc2 enltrHurricane Helene was not just catastrophic, it was a historic storm for the entire southeast and Appalachia.\par \par \uc2 We're mobilizing every resource to ensure displaced families can begin to return home and devastated communities can begin to rebuild.\par \par \uc2 My Administration has your back. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/4ITL8e3kS3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/4ITL8e3kS3}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 President Biden (@POTUS) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/POTUS/status/1840951241444135072?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 October 1, 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 Helene {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/sep/27/hurricane-helene-landfall-florida"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 made landfall}}}\uc2  last Thursday in {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/florida"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Florida}}}\uc2  \u8217\'20\'19s Big Bend region as a category 4 hurricane. Even though it weakened to a tropical storm before moving through Georgia, the Carolinas and Tennessee, the storm\u8217\'20\'19s winds, rainfall, storm surge and flooding ravaged entire communities in its path and has left over 1 million Americans without power. More than 120 people are reported to have been killed across several states.\par \par \uc2 The Biden administration and local officials have struggled to deliver support to the most heavily impacted states areas, where many survivors have been stranded with no electricity or running water.\par \par \uc2 Biden will visit {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/northcarolina"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 North Carolina}}}\uc2 , where the western part of the state has been devastated by flooding, tomorrow. Presidential candidates \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2  and \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  have expressed condolences to those impacted by the hurricane and are receiving recovery briefings from \uc2 Federal Emergency Management Agency\uc2  ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/sep/29/hurricane-helene-historic-flooding-global-heating-fema"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Fema}}}\uc2  ).\par \par \uc2 block-time updated-timeUpdated at 11.41am BST\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 11.15am BST\par \par \uc2 Trump says he will do play-by-play commentary on VP debate\par \par \uc2 Democratic US vice-president \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2  and former Republican president \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  are expected to watch the VP debate tonight, and Trump has said he would offer a play-by-play commentary of the event on social media.\par \par \uc2 Harris was viewed by many {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/profile/lauren-gambino"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 as the winner of her debate with Trump on 10 September}}}\uc2  in Philadelphia, which was watched by an estimated 67 million people. Most of the national polls carried out in the week after indicated that her performance had helped her make small gains in the race.\par \par \uc2 Her lead over Trump rose from 2.5 percentage points on the day of the debate to 3.3 points just over a week later. However, the battleground states \u8211\'20\'13 where the election will be decided \u8211\'20\'13 remain too close to call. Only one or two percentage points are separating the presidential candidates.\par \par \uc2 According to Reuters/\uc2 Ipsos\uc2  polling, 51% of registered voters say they view JD Vance unfavorably, compared with 39% who view him favourably. That\u8217\'20\'19s a contrast with \uc2 Tim Walz\uc2 , who 44% of registered voters view favourably, with 43% reporting an unfavorable view. These results came from a poll conducted between 20 and 23 September.\par \par \uc2 block-time updated-timeUpdated at 12.54pm BST\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 10.53am BST\par \par \uc2 Kit Maher, a campaign producer with CNN\u8217\'20\'19s political unit, has been told by two sources that these are the surrogates for JD Vance who will be in the spin room for him tonight at the debate:\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Jason Miller\uc2 , senior adviser to \uc2 Donald Trump\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Donald Trump Jr\uc2 , \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s son\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Tom Cotton, Arkansas senator\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Katie Britt, Alabama senator\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Elise Stefanik\uc2 , a congresswoman representing New York\u8217\'20\'19s 21st district in the House of Representatives and serves as the House Republican conference chair\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Byron Donalds, a Republican Florida congressman\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Howard Lutnick\uc2 , the longtime chief executive officer of \uc2 Cantor Fitzgerald LP\par \par \uc2 enltrJD Vance surrogates in the spin room tomorrow, per two sources familiar:\par \par \uc2 Senior Trump Campaign Adviser \uc2 Jason Miller\par \par \uc2 Donald Trump Jr.\par \par \uc2 Arkansas Sen. Tom Cotton\par \par \uc2 Alabama Sen. Katie Britt\par \par \uc2 House Republican Conference Chair \uc2 Elise Stefanik\par \par \uc2 Florida Rep. Byron Donalds\par \par \uc2 CEO of Cantor\u8230\'20\'26\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Kit Maher (@KitMaherCNN) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/KitMaherCNN/status/1840798179064774801?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 September 30, 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 The 90-minute debate between Vance, 40, a senator for Ohio, and \uc2 Tim Walz\uc2 , the 60-year-old governor of Minnesota, will kick off at 9pm New York time and can be viewed on host network CBS News. We will be bringing you the latest updates in our live blog.\par \par \uc2 block-time updated-timeUpdated at 11.33am BST\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 10.25am BST\par \par \uc2 My colleague {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/profile/rachel-leingang"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Rachel Leingang}}}\uc2  took a look at what we know so far about Vance and Walz\u8217\'20\'19s debate style. She writes:\par \par \uc2 Walz, the Democratic governor of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/minnesota"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Minnesota}}}\uc2 , and Vance, a Republican senator from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/ohio"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ohio}}}\uc2 , have been honing their public speaking skills \u8211\'20\'13 and their {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/article/2024/aug/11/vance-targets-harris-walz"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pointed barbs}}}\uc2  at each other \u8211\'20\'13 in TV appearances and at events around the country in the past few months.\par \par \uc2 Their experiences in electoral debates haven\u8217\'20\'19t reached the levels or notoriety that come along with a presidential campaign, but both have faced opponents in public debates in past elections.\par \par \uc2 And given the tightness of the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/us-elections-2024"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 presidential race}}}\uc2 , and how {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/article/2024/jun/27/trump-biden-cnn-presidential-debate-reaction-highlights"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 poorly the first presidential debate}}}\uc2  between {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/joebiden"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Joe Biden}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/donaldtrump"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Donald Trump}}}\uc2  went, there will probably be more people tuned in to the vice presidential debate than in past cycles.\par \par \uc2 While VP debates don\u8217\'20\'19t usually tip the scales much, they could matter in a close race \u8211\'20\'13 and they build profiles for lower-profile politicians who will probably stay on the national scene for years to come.\par \par \uc2 You can read the full story here:\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/sep/30/jd-vance-tim-walz-vice-presidential-debate-styles"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 What we know so far about JD Vance and Tim Walz\u8217\'20\'19s debate styles}}}\par \par \uc2 block-time updated-timeUpdated at 10.39am BST\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 10.08am BST\par \par \uc2 Tim Walz\uc2  and JD Vance to face off in VP debate\par \par \uc2 Good morning, US politics readers.\par \par \uc2 It\u8217\'20\'19s the day of the vice-presidential debate and \uc2 Tim Walz\uc2  and JD Vance are preparing to go head to head in New York City.\par \par \uc2 The debate will start at 9pm ET and, like the Harris-Trump debate, it will be held in a studio without an audience. Unlike the main presidential debate, the candidates\u8217\'20\'19 microphones will not be muted when it is not their turn to speak \u8211\'20\'13 but moderators can mute mics throughout the event.\par \par \uc2 To practice before Tuesday\u8217\'20\'19s VP debate, Walz has used \uc2 Pete Buttigieg\uc2 , transportation secretary and frequent {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/article/2024/sep/02/democrats-buttigieg-sanders-fox-news-appearances-election"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TV news interviewee}}}\uc2 , as a Vance stand-in \u8211\'20\'13 both Buttigieg and Vance are Ivy Leaguers from the midwest and roughly the same age.\par \par \uc2 Vance has been preparing for the debate with Minnesota Republican congressman \uc2 Tom Emmer\uc2  as a stand-in for Walz. On Monday, Emmer gave an insight into how debate practice has been going, telling reporters about portraying Walz: \u8220\'20\'1CQuite frankly it\u8217\'20\'19s tough because he is really good on the debate stage.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Republicans are seeking to frame Walz, the folksy Minnesota governor who has proved to be {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://projects.fivethirtyeight.com/polls/favorability/tim-walz/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 the most popular figure}}}\uc2  in the presidential race, as a mean-spirited, ogreish figure. Emmer, who ran unsuccessfully for Minnesota governor in 2010, said: \u8220\'20\'1C[Walz] is going to stand there and he lies with conviction, and he has these little mannerisms where he\u8217\'20\'19s just, hey, I\u8217\'20\'19m the nice guy, but he\u8217\'20\'19s not nice at all.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 block-time updated-timeUpdated at 10.54am BST\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020241001eka10010c\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
FF
